YULIA IVANOVA


00:02:18.878 --> 00:02:22.336
PRODUCED BY ANTON ZLATOPOLSKIY,
RUBEN DISHDISHYAN, LEONARD BLAVATNIK


00:02:22.503 --> 00:02:24.628
LEONID VERESHAGIN
NIKITA MIKHALKOV


00:02:33.711 --> 00:02:34.878
Give me an axe.


00:02:35.878 --> 00:02:39.586
WRITTEN AND DIRECTED
BY ALEKSEY SIDOROV


00:02:53.378 --> 00:02:57.211
Hurry up!
I don't feel good about the place!


00:03:18.961 --> 00:03:20.503
Comrade Junior Lieutenant...


00:03:24.128 --> 00:03:25.961
That's better.


00:03:27.961 --> 00:03:29.503
The Germans!


00:03:40.628 --> 00:03:42.753
Move over!


00:03:48.128 --> 00:03:49.378
Where are you going?!


00:03:49.586 --> 00:03:50.503
Are you nuts?!


00:03:50.503 --> 00:03:53.295
We'll make it! They
have to turn the turret!


00:04:00.878 --> 00:04:02.628
Get down!


00:04:15.753 --> 00:04:19.878
When the turret comes to a stop,
you count to four! Loud!


00:04:24.003 --> 00:04:25.628
One!


00:04:25.836 --> 00:04:28.003
Two! Three!


00:04:28.128 --> 00:04:30.003
Four!


00:04:34.878 --> 00:04:36.503
- Are you okay? Keep counting!
- Yes, sir!


00:04:37.753 --> 00:04:38.753
You count!


00:04:39.253 --> 00:04:41.336
Two! Three!


00:04:42.086 --> 00:04:43.628
Four!


00:04:50.128 --> 00:04:51.586
He is going to shoot now!


00:04:52.003 --> 00:04:54.253
- Step on it, buddy!
- Keep counting!


00:05:01.461 --> 00:05:05.003
Two! Three! Four!


00:05:10.628 --> 00:05:12.253
Son of a bitch...


00:05:20.128 --> 00:05:21.253
Hang on!


00:05:41.753 --> 00:05:44.253
- Are you okay?
- I think I am.


00:05:47.836 --> 00:05:49.878
My name is Nikolai.


00:05:50.836 --> 00:05:52.586
I am Vassya.


00:05:57.878 --> 00:06:00.628
- Poplar calling Mignonette. Do you copy?
- You must stop them!


00:06:00.836 --> 00:06:02.378
I know!


00:06:02.586 --> 00:06:04.878
- Repeat! I can't read you!
- Battalion Commander!


00:06:05.003 --> 00:06:08.086
Comrade Colonel, my battalion has been
reduced to a single tank.


00:06:08.253 --> 00:06:13.086
- Where are the rest of them?
- Knocked out or given to the infantry.


00:06:13.586 --> 00:06:16.503
I don't even have a tank commander.
All of them were killed.


00:06:16.628 --> 00:06:18.753
- I would do it but...
- Fight to the bitter end!


00:06:20.961 --> 00:06:23.878
Yes, Comrade Colonel.


00:06:31.253 --> 00:06:33.836
Give me a light.


00:06:35.003 --> 00:06:37.961
The Germans are approaching
the village of Nefedovo.


00:06:41.628 --> 00:06:43.003
Here is our order.


00:06:43.211 --> 00:06:47.878
We cover the retreat of the brigade's
staff office and the mobile hospital.


00:06:54.461 --> 00:06:56.253
Good evening, Comrade Captain!


00:06:56.253 --> 00:06:59.086
Junior Lieutenant Ivushkin,
present for duty!


00:06:59.753 --> 00:07:02.628
Reporting. The kitchen truck held off


00:07:02.753 --> 00:07:05.753
a mean attack of an enemy tank on the way.


00:07:06.086 --> 00:07:09.128
The hot meals have been delivered.


00:07:13.628 --> 00:07:16.211
- Are you an armor officer?
- Yes, Comrade Captain.


00:07:22.253 --> 00:07:24.336
Buddy.


00:07:25.753 --> 00:07:28.961
Stalin is the only person
I want to see more than you now.


00:07:30.586 --> 00:07:32.878
Fall in!


00:07:38.836 --> 00:07:40.753
Attention!


00:07:41.836 --> 00:07:44.378
Meet your new tank commander.


00:07:44.586 --> 00:07:48.378
Junior Lieutenant Ivushkin.
Please, welcome.


00:07:49.836 --> 00:07:53.128
- Good evening, comrade tankmen!
- Hello, sir.


00:07:53.253 --> 00:07:54.878
He will brief you.


00:07:55.628 --> 00:07:57.586
You are our only hope, guys.


00:07:57.753 --> 00:07:59.503
Break a leg.


00:08:00.461 --> 00:08:02.586
Sure thing.


00:08:05.336 --> 00:08:07.461
At ease.


00:08:09.128 --> 00:08:10.336
I sense no fighting spirit.


00:08:11.378 --> 00:08:14.878
Will you give us a mission briefing, sir?


00:08:15.503 --> 00:08:18.003
The Germans broke through
our lines at Nefedovo.


00:08:18.128 --> 00:08:20.753
We must hold the village and cover


00:08:20.878 --> 00:08:23.253
the retreat of the staff office
and the hospital.


00:08:23.378 --> 00:08:25.128
What's the recon on the German force?


00:08:25.503 --> 00:08:27.336
A company. Maybe more.


00:08:27.503 --> 00:08:29.461
- Infantry?
- Tanks.


00:08:33.128 --> 00:08:34.503
Are you kidding us?


00:08:34.711 --> 00:08:38.378
- With a single tank and no support?
- We'll have some support.


00:08:38.878 --> 00:08:41.378
From an infantry squad.


00:08:42.628 --> 00:08:44.878
No way. We are not that stupid.


00:08:45.003 --> 00:08:47.086
Pavlo, give me a gun. I will shoot myself.


00:08:47.253 --> 00:08:49.378
Hush, dudes!


00:08:50.628 --> 00:08:54.003
Comrade Lieutenant, we have been fighting
for a week with no sleep at all.


00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:57.461
We survived the rest of the battalion
by pure miracle.


00:08:57.503 --> 00:08:59.211
You want to slaughter us now?


00:08:59.253 --> 00:09:02.753
Today is his first day on the frontline.
What else can he say?


00:09:05.003 --> 00:09:07.378
Anyone else wants to speak out?


00:09:09.003 --> 00:09:11.086
Now you listen to me.


00:09:11.586 --> 00:09:15.336
Today is my first day on the frontline.


00:09:15.711 --> 00:09:18.503
But I was an A student in the tank school.


00:09:19.753 --> 00:09:22.253
Make way.


00:09:25.836 --> 00:09:28.961
The tank is not on station
even though in the rest area. Why?


00:09:29.128 --> 00:09:30.628
You think we are at a health resort?


00:09:32.128 --> 00:09:33.753
Is the caponier 1,5 meters long?


00:09:34.961 --> 00:09:36.586
But it has to be minimum 2 meters long.


00:09:37.253 --> 00:09:38.628
Were you too lazy?


00:09:39.211 --> 00:09:41.628
Why did you store the ammo here?


00:09:44.003 --> 00:09:46.378
I can't hear you.


00:09:47.128 --> 00:09:49.753
And I don't think I will.


00:09:53.628 --> 00:09:56.503
- What's your name, comrade driver?
- Vasilenok.


00:09:56.753 --> 00:09:59.753
Good that you keep
the engine warm, Vasilenok.


00:10:00.003 --> 00:10:01.628
But why is the oil leaking?


00:10:02.503 --> 00:10:05.586
- Fix it now.
- Yes, sir.


00:10:07.086 --> 00:10:08.878
We have our orders.


00:10:10.211 --> 00:10:14.753
I am warning you.
I will equal nagging to cowardice.


00:10:16.045 --> 00:10:19.503
And I will punish it
under the laws of war.


00:10:20.503 --> 00:10:22.586
Is that clear?


00:10:24.878 --> 00:10:29.086
The enemy is a stone's throw away
from Moscow. Stop whining!


00:10:29.711 --> 00:10:31.378
What a disgrace!


00:10:31.836 --> 00:10:37.086
A single tank can do a lot of damage to
the enemy when its crew knows their trade.


00:10:38.378 --> 00:10:41.128
Comrade Junior Lieutenant,
Sergeant Gabulia reporting for service.


00:10:41.753 --> 00:10:44.128
One minute, please.


00:10:44.336 --> 00:10:47.378
Tankmen, fall in! Attention!


00:10:49.253 --> 00:10:51.128
At my command!


00:10:51.836 --> 00:10:54.878
Inspect the tank
and prepare it for action!


00:10:55.003 --> 00:10:56.461
Load extra ammo.


00:10:57.336 --> 00:11:00.878
- Remove everything you don't need.
- May I keep my harmonica?


00:11:01.753 --> 00:11:04.503
- Are you good at playing it?
- Not bad.


00:11:04.628 --> 00:11:06.378
Permission granted.


00:11:06.503 --> 00:11:08.586
RELENTLESS


00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.378
The low morning sun
will blind the Fritzes.


00:11:16.586 --> 00:11:19.586
I will take this position here.


00:11:21.503 --> 00:11:23.711
I will stay here and draw their fire.


00:11:24.836 --> 00:11:26.253
The road is winding here.


00:11:26.295 --> 00:11:28.961
The Fritzes will expose
their sides to you.


00:11:29.003 --> 00:11:32.503
- It is a good strategy, comrade Gabulia.
- It is all about experience.


00:11:41.753 --> 00:11:45.086
- Can I give you a hand?
- We'll manage, comrade commander. You...


00:11:46.503 --> 00:11:48.878
You command.


00:11:51.503 --> 00:11:52.503
Dear Mommy.


00:11:52.711 --> 00:11:55.253
Please, don't worry. I am perfectly fine.


00:11:55.878 --> 00:11:58.753
We are beating the Fritzes hard.


00:11:58.961 --> 00:12:01.253
Regards to Auntie Manya.


00:12:01.461 --> 00:12:04.461
Kisses. Your Nikolai.


00:12:43.961 --> 00:12:47.336
- The Russians are planning something.
- You think so?


00:12:50.253 --> 00:12:52.086
The village looks too serene.


00:12:52.253 --> 00:12:54.086
Remember, Wolff.


00:12:55.003 --> 00:12:57.503
The Russians are always
planning something.


00:12:57.545 --> 00:12:58.378
Coffee?


00:13:02.878 --> 00:13:04.628
Damn frosts!


00:13:05.503 --> 00:13:07.253
I can't get used to this chilly weather.


00:13:08.253 --> 00:13:10.378
The beard should keep you warm.


00:13:10.503 --> 00:13:12.253
When are you going to shave it off?


00:13:13.086 --> 00:13:15.003
You look like an Ivan now.


00:13:16.503 --> 00:13:19.128
Probably, in a week.
When we seize Moscow.


00:13:21.836 --> 00:13:25.586
I bet my watch that we'll beat everyone
to the Red Square.


00:13:25.753 --> 00:13:28.003
Now we should make it there.


00:13:28.211 --> 00:13:29.711
Start the engines.


00:13:31.628 --> 00:13:33.253
Crews, get ready!


00:13:33.836 --> 00:13:36.878
The convoy distance is 25 meters.
Forward! Move!


00:13:51.503 --> 00:13:56.503
Here they are. They look like head lice
crawling away from kerosene!


00:14:09.003 --> 00:14:10.253
Three...


00:14:10.461 --> 00:14:12.628
Four, five...


00:14:13.753 --> 00:14:18.461
Beautiful. They follow their commander
like goslings follow the mother goose.


00:14:19.003 --> 00:14:20.836
The mother goose looks familiar to me.


00:14:29.128 --> 00:14:30.753
Okay, Fritz...


00:14:30.961 --> 00:14:32.461
Ready to bump heads?


00:14:33.628 --> 00:14:37.253
- Crew, prepare for action!
- Yes, sir.


00:14:37.753 --> 00:14:39.961
Kobzarenko, an armor-piercing shell!


00:14:43.211 --> 00:14:44.211
Up!


00:14:56.836 --> 00:14:59.836
Let's do it, commander!
What if the engine fails?


00:15:00.003 --> 00:15:03.753
You'll have to re-start it then!
Keep it cool, comrade driver!


00:15:05.128 --> 00:15:07.628
Show me your side, uber alles shithead.


00:15:07.753 --> 00:15:09.503
Move in.


00:15:15.003 --> 00:15:16.753
Crews, stop!


00:15:17.961 --> 00:15:19.253
Shit...


00:15:20.628 --> 00:15:23.253
Shut down the engines!


00:15:24.128 --> 00:15:25.503
Did he sense danger?


00:15:25.753 --> 00:15:27.211
What's going on out there?


00:15:27.378 --> 00:15:28.753
Keep quiet.


00:15:33.628 --> 00:15:35.628
Give me a crowbar.


00:15:51.378 --> 00:15:54.461
Too quiet.
I can't hear any dogs barking.


00:15:55.086 --> 00:15:56.503
Come on, Guram.


00:15:56.711 --> 00:15:58.253
You are our only hope now.


00:16:22.003 --> 00:16:25.253
Attention! An anti-tank gun
in the barn at 11 o'clock!


00:16:32.003 --> 00:16:36.003
Yes! That was smart, Guram!
They took the bait.


00:16:36.711 --> 00:16:40.336
Get out of there, Guram!
Before they shoot!


00:16:41.461 --> 00:16:44.253
Tanks 22 and 33, take out the gun!


00:16:44.378 --> 00:16:45.461
They took the bait!


00:16:45.753 --> 00:16:47.503
Let's go!


00:16:55.086 --> 00:16:59.003
Damn, Vasechkin! I said, we go!


00:17:04.503 --> 00:17:06.586
Move!


00:17:19.211 --> 00:17:21.836
Shoot, comrade commander!
What are you waiting for?


00:17:22.003 --> 00:17:23.378
Too early, comrade driver!


00:17:25.128 --> 00:17:27.461
Now get this, gosling. Quack-quack!


00:17:50.961 --> 00:17:51.670
Holy cow!


00:17:51.711 --> 00:17:53.878
You took out two of
them with a single shot!


00:17:59.753 --> 00:18:02.711
Tank in the haystack at 1 o'clock!
Tanks 14 and 15, destroy it!


00:18:09.003 --> 00:18:11.128
- The third one is out!
- I love it!


00:18:12.086 --> 00:18:14.503
- Vasilenok, start the engine!
- I am on it!


00:18:29.086 --> 00:18:32.378
Vasilenok, what the hell
are you waiting for? Move out, now!


00:18:32.586 --> 00:18:35.711
The road is too muddy!


00:18:37.128 --> 00:18:38.503
Wolff, what are you waiting for?


00:18:39.836 --> 00:18:41.003
I know what I am doing.


00:18:41.211 --> 00:18:42.961
Shit! I can't pierce
through their head armor.


00:18:43.086 --> 00:18:44.086
Fire!


00:18:56.336 --> 00:18:58.711
That's a good start, comrade commander!


00:19:00.128 --> 00:19:01.836
Great job!


00:19:02.003 --> 00:19:03.628
Today is my first day on the frontline.


00:19:05.878 --> 00:19:08.253
Vasilenok, take us
to the alternate position.


00:19:29.003 --> 00:19:31.003
- Target not identified!
- Cease the fire!


00:20:04.378 --> 00:20:07.128
Comrade Sergeant,
permission to open fire.


00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:08.086
Negative.


00:20:08.378 --> 00:20:10.753
We wait for the tankmen.


00:20:25.753 --> 00:20:29.836
- Another one!
- Four tanks out!


00:20:30.128 --> 00:20:31.753
Do it!


00:20:41.378 --> 00:20:43.128
Rotate to 2 o'clock!
The target is in the stable.


00:20:43.253 --> 00:20:44.628
Got it!


00:20:44.753 --> 00:20:45.878
Identified!


00:20:57.003 --> 00:20:58.128
- Up!
- Fire!


00:21:00.128 --> 00:21:01.586
Shit!


00:21:02.753 --> 00:21:04.086
He is going away!


00:21:05.628 --> 00:21:07.753
Infantry! Smoke the Russian tank out!


00:21:20.128 --> 00:21:21.628
Vasilenok, start the engine!


00:21:21.753 --> 00:21:23.378
The Fritzes are out there!


00:21:23.503 --> 00:21:24.753
I got it!


00:21:27.878 --> 00:21:31.086
- Good job, Makheev! Hold the ground!
- Ammunition pan!


00:21:31.461 --> 00:21:34.253
- At any cost!
- Yes, Comrade Sergeant!


00:21:37.045 --> 00:21:40.711
Warmest greetings from the young
communists of the Amur River region!


00:21:57.211 --> 00:21:58.878
Come on, come on.


00:22:05.753 --> 00:22:07.336
Bye-bye...


00:22:12.878 --> 00:22:15.711
An armor-piercing one!
Stop at the gates!


00:22:15.753 --> 00:22:16.753
Yes, sir!


00:22:51.253 --> 00:22:52.503
The fifth one is out!


00:22:52.753 --> 00:22:55.628
- Move on. We hide behind the stable!
- Got it!


00:23:10.628 --> 00:23:12.253
- Crew!
- It didn't go through!


00:23:12.461 --> 00:23:14.211
Vasilenok, quick right turn!


00:23:15.628 --> 00:23:17.753
- I am on it!
- Quick right turn!


00:23:17.961 --> 00:23:19.878
This is no toboggan!


00:23:20.086 --> 00:23:22.836
Just do it!


00:23:32.711 --> 00:23:34.003
Move out behind the stable!


00:23:53.003 --> 00:23:56.086
- The Fritz is at our right side!
- Move out to cover!


00:23:56.253 --> 00:23:59.128
They trapped us like hunters trap a wolf!


00:23:59.336 --> 00:24:02.586
Essay assignments.
My Homeland. My Home Village.


00:24:11.086 --> 00:24:12.211
Crew, stop!


00:24:14.586 --> 00:24:16.461
Rotate to one o'clock!


00:24:23.461 --> 00:24:25.503
Kobzarenko, an armor-piercing shell!


00:24:26.753 --> 00:24:27.961
I got you now.


00:24:52.586 --> 00:24:53.878
The enemy tank is destroyed.


00:25:11.336 --> 00:25:13.753
Are you okay?


00:25:14.253 --> 00:25:16.253
Ganya!


00:25:18.628 --> 00:25:20.378
Ganya!


00:25:23.128 --> 00:25:24.878
Ganya is gone!


00:25:27.878 --> 00:25:30.003
Calm down!


00:25:32.628 --> 00:25:34.378
Comrade Sergeant!


00:25:35.503 --> 00:25:38.336
- Comrade Sergeant!
- Grenades.


00:25:45.461 --> 00:25:47.836
Kobzarenko, an armor-piercing shell!


00:25:49.128 --> 00:25:51.878
Vasilenok, take us away from here!


00:25:52.253 --> 00:25:55.003
- Yes, comrade commander!
- Step on it, buddy!


00:26:00.378 --> 00:26:01.378
What?!


00:26:06.128 --> 00:26:07.878
Load!


00:26:09.878 --> 00:26:12.003
Driver, dodge it!


00:26:16.628 --> 00:26:18.086
Up!


00:26:18.836 --> 00:26:20.628
Fire at will!


00:26:30.128 --> 00:26:31.128
He is good!


00:26:32.628 --> 00:26:35.753
Aim at the one by the gates of the stable!


00:26:35.961 --> 00:26:37.253
Got it!


00:26:38.586 --> 00:26:41.628
Come on! The right side!


00:26:43.836 --> 00:26:45.878
Stop!


00:26:47.253 --> 00:26:49.878
Driver, move out! Come on, buddy!


00:27:32.336 --> 00:27:36.253
- Shit!
- Keep it cool! Keep it cool, Wolff.


00:27:46.253 --> 00:27:48.128
- Comrade driver!
- Yes, sir!


00:27:48.878 --> 00:27:52.336
- What's your name?
- Stepan Savelyevich!


00:27:53.003 --> 00:27:57.378
Good job, Stepan Savelyevich.
Thanks for your efforts!


00:27:57.586 --> 00:28:00.461
Serving the people of labor!


00:28:01.878 --> 00:28:06.086
Good. Now it's just you and me.


00:28:07.253 --> 00:28:11.003
Okay, Fritz, let's drop gloves now.


00:28:11.586 --> 00:28:13.878
Let's do it, Stepan Savelyevich!


00:28:15.628 --> 00:28:18.628
You asked for it!


00:28:21.836 --> 00:28:24.461
Load! Move! Forward!


00:28:28.086 --> 00:28:31.211
Kobzarenko, an armor-piercing shell!
Vasilenok, move out!


00:28:31.753 --> 00:28:34.128
A cherry orchard by my house...


00:28:43.961 --> 00:28:45.211
Fire at will!


00:28:57.961 --> 00:29:01.378
May bugs are humming in the trees...


00:29:13.461 --> 00:29:17.878
Farmers are bringing their ploughs
to the fields...


00:29:24.128 --> 00:29:30.253
The girls are singing...


00:29:51.503 --> 00:29:55.378
And their mothers are waiting
for them for dinner...


00:29:56.336 --> 00:29:57.628
Shit!


00:29:58.628 --> 00:30:01.336
- I am wounded!
- Wolff, get yourself together!


00:30:01.503 --> 00:30:02.628
Do you want to die here?


00:30:02.836 --> 00:30:05.211
Quick left turn!


00:30:20.086 --> 00:30:21.961
Stop!


00:30:28.378 --> 00:30:31.378
- I can't do it...
- Wolff!


00:30:34.253 --> 00:30:35.878
Prepare to fire, soldier.


00:30:40.753 --> 00:30:44.378
Driver! Short cut to the house!


00:31:11.378 --> 00:31:14.128
And their mothers are waiting
for them for dinner...


00:31:48.211 --> 00:31:50.253
Shit! Load!


00:31:51.128 --> 00:31:52.878
Aim at the fuel tank!


00:32:12.128 --> 00:32:14.253
Kobzarenko...


00:32:31.003 --> 00:32:33.753
Son of a bitch...


00:33:33.003 --> 00:33:37.128
Hang on...


00:34:53.503 --> 00:34:57.211
1944. THE THIRD REICH


00:34:57.711 --> 00:35:01.586
THURINGIA. S III CONCENTRATION CAMP


00:36:12.128 --> 00:36:14.003
Welcome to our resort!


00:36:14.753 --> 00:36:17.336
Our resort is very special.


00:36:17.503 --> 00:36:21.253
This is the place where we separate
the sheep from the goats.


00:36:34.628 --> 00:36:37.003
Remember all you who enter:


00:36:37.503 --> 00:36:41.503
you don't have any thoughts or emotions.


00:36:47.586 --> 00:36:48.961
The Germans are your masters.


00:36:49.878 --> 00:36:53.586
The Germans decide whether you live,
or you die.


00:36:55.628 --> 00:36:57.128
Attention!


00:36:58.003 --> 00:37:00.086
Down!


00:37:26.878 --> 00:37:30.128
Look at me. Are you Russian?


00:37:31.711 --> 00:37:35.878
Herr Commandant,
they call him the Russian Tankman.


00:37:38.503 --> 00:37:42.628
His identity and military rank
are unknown. 7 escape attempts.


00:37:53.378 --> 00:37:55.003
What is your name and your rank?


00:37:59.628 --> 00:38:02.503
I asked for your name and rank.


00:38:03.211 --> 00:38:06.211
Please, answer him. You can't keep silent.


00:38:30.503 --> 00:38:34.503
You are special, Tankman.
Do you want to die standing?


00:38:41.003 --> 00:38:43.253
- Place him in the special unit.
- Yes, sir.


00:39:15.128 --> 00:39:17.128
Your name and your rank?


00:39:23.753 --> 00:39:27.086
Make sure he doesn't kick the bucket.
I will make him talk.


00:39:47.753 --> 00:39:49.253
They are here.


00:39:58.461 --> 00:40:02.003
- Gentlemen.
- Herr Reichsfuhrer.


00:40:05.336 --> 00:40:09.503
General Guderian briefed me about
your report, Standartenfuhrer Jager.


00:40:10.711 --> 00:40:13.128
Your suggestion comes at the right moment.


00:40:13.336 --> 00:40:15.170
Herr Reichsfuhrer, in a short while


00:40:15.170 --> 00:40:17.253
the Russian tanks will descend
upon our borders.


00:40:17.461 --> 00:40:20.503
If we fail to take urgent measures,
the Reich will be doomed.


00:40:21.128 --> 00:40:26.336
I want to train tank supermen
who can stop the Red Army.


00:40:27.753 --> 00:40:31.628
Do you hate the Russians, Jager?


00:40:34.378 --> 00:40:38.503
I am a soldier.
I am not influenced by sentiment.


00:40:39.503 --> 00:40:42.336
My duty is to serve my Motherland.


00:40:45.503 --> 00:40:48.003
Herr Inspector General,


00:40:48.378 --> 00:40:50.503
I put Standartenfuhrer Jager


00:40:50.670 --> 00:40:52.420
in charge of the tank battalion


00:40:52.461 --> 00:40:54.545
with the SS Panzer Division
"Hitlerjugend".


00:40:57.253 --> 00:40:59.503
Yes, Herr Reichsfuhrer!


00:41:03.711 --> 00:41:08.878
The future of the Reich is
in your hands now, Standartenfuhrer.


00:41:54.836 --> 00:41:57.086
We found 27 people for you,
Herr Standartenfuhrer.


00:41:57.878 --> 00:42:00.128
But no armor officers among them.


00:42:00.461 --> 00:42:02.461
Permission to explain.


00:42:02.753 --> 00:42:04.920
In an attempt to escape
the well-deserved retaliation,


00:42:05.253 --> 00:42:07.128
captured officers say they are privates


00:42:07.253 --> 00:42:10.003
- or sergeants.
- Good.


00:42:10.211 --> 00:42:12.253
Those who hide want to survive.


00:42:12.378 --> 00:42:14.711
I want an officer who wants to survive.


00:42:15.378 --> 00:42:17.628
A tank commander.


00:42:40.461 --> 00:42:42.503
Who is he?


00:42:43.961 --> 00:42:46.878
I am afraid, he is the worst option,
Herr Standartenfuhrer.


00:42:47.003 --> 00:42:48.753
This Ivan has got a death wish.


00:42:48.878 --> 00:42:53.003
He was taken prisoner in 1941.
But he never told us his name or rank.


00:42:53.961 --> 00:42:58.211
7 escape attempts.
He was brought here for execution.


00:43:02.336 --> 00:43:04.503
Jager, are you okay?


00:43:07.503 --> 00:43:10.086
We found the right man.


00:43:11.128 --> 00:43:14.253
Hauptsturmfuhrer, we are
on a highly classified mission here.


00:43:14.378 --> 00:43:17.336
I want a competent Russian interpreter.


00:43:17.503 --> 00:43:20.211
Someone from inside the camp. Expendable.


00:43:21.586 --> 00:43:23.378
Right now!


00:43:41.378 --> 00:43:43.628
Long time no see, soldier.


00:43:49.753 --> 00:43:54.586
You remember November 27, 1941?


00:43:56.003 --> 00:43:58.253
The village of Nefedovo?


00:44:21.336 --> 00:44:23.836
You commanded the armor company I crushed.


00:44:30.378 --> 00:44:32.836
But I shot you.


00:44:33.336 --> 00:44:35.586
You look good.


00:44:45.586 --> 00:44:46.878
You are hopeless.


00:44:48.628 --> 00:44:50.253
And unfit for service.


00:44:55.378 --> 00:44:57.753
You are subject to elimination.


00:45:12.753 --> 00:45:14.753
I am going to give you a second chance.


00:45:17.878 --> 00:45:20.711
You will put together a Russian tank crew
and train them.


00:45:26.920 --> 00:45:29.711
One day you will go
to the training grounds


00:45:29.878 --> 00:45:32.836
and show my cadets all you can do.


00:45:34.878 --> 00:45:37.461
You will have no shells.


00:45:38.378 --> 00:45:40.586
Nothing but your skills.


00:45:47.003 --> 00:45:50.211
If you die, you die on a battlefield.


00:45:54.128 --> 00:45:55.753
If you survive,


00:45:57.753 --> 00:46:00.586
you will train crews for me.


00:46:00.753 --> 00:46:05.628
I already had a crew killed.
My first crew.


00:46:15.253 --> 00:46:18.003
You fought well.


00:46:18.711 --> 00:46:22.128
We fought on our own land, you Fritz.


00:46:30.628 --> 00:46:32.378
I am waiting for your answer.


00:46:36.503 --> 00:46:38.628
Screw you.


00:47:07.503 --> 00:47:09.753
I am counting to five.


00:47:14.711 --> 00:47:16.753
One.


00:47:19.628 --> 00:47:21.753
Two.


00:47:38.711 --> 00:47:41.336
Enough! I'll do it!


00:47:49.753 --> 00:47:51.586
You don't have to translate it.


00:48:07.253 --> 00:48:08.586
That was smart, soldier.


00:48:11.378 --> 00:48:13.628
Your name and rank?


00:48:15.211 --> 00:48:18.503
Junior Lieutenant Ivushkin.


00:48:36.753 --> 00:48:39.628
Get up! Take him away!


00:48:43.253 --> 00:48:47.378
Sample Boots #28 stood the test.
The tear and wear is acceptable.


00:49:08.503 --> 00:49:10.503
The camp is ready for inspection.


00:49:11.128 --> 00:49:14.128
18 382 prisoners are present.


00:49:14.586 --> 00:49:16.628
385 people are ill.


00:49:16.753 --> 00:49:18.628
32 people died last night.


00:49:19.503 --> 00:49:21.378
Very good.


00:49:24.336 --> 00:49:26.086
The camp is ready for inspection.


00:49:26.628 --> 00:49:29.711
18 382 prisoners are present.


00:49:30.836 --> 00:49:32.753
Call them out.


00:50:16.003 --> 00:50:17.628
You stand in awe now.


00:50:20.128 --> 00:50:22.961
This kind man is going
to call out the chosen ones!


00:51:55.878 --> 00:51:57.753
These people can do it.


00:52:01.503 --> 00:52:03.628
These people can do it.


00:52:37.128 --> 00:52:40.128
Holy shit, what is this thing?


00:52:40.503 --> 00:52:44.461
Looks like a T-34. But not exactly.


00:52:45.003 --> 00:52:47.878
It is a T-34.
Straight from the battlefield.


00:52:48.003 --> 00:52:51.628
- Equipped with an 85 mm gun.
- At least.


00:53:14.836 --> 00:53:16.503
You have a week to fix the tank


00:53:19.086 --> 00:53:21.378
and to prepare it for the test.


00:53:28.003 --> 00:53:32.128
This is the newest Russian tank. It was
captured at the Eastern front 3 days ago.


00:53:32.253 --> 00:53:34.003
It can allegedly defeat our Panthers.


00:53:38.961 --> 00:53:43.003
First of all, you remove the dead bodies
and clean the turret.


00:53:45.461 --> 00:53:47.003
Get to work.


00:53:50.753 --> 00:53:52.628
Crew, fall in!


00:54:36.753 --> 00:54:42.211
From now on, I am your commander. You
execute my orders without any hesitation.


00:54:43.378 --> 00:54:45.336
Permission to speak, comrade commander.


00:54:45.753 --> 00:54:46.836
Granted.


00:54:47.086 --> 00:54:49.128
What is our mission?


00:54:50.128 --> 00:54:52.753
Our one and only mission
is to fight the enemy.


00:54:54.503 --> 00:54:57.961
We are temporarily under the control
of this son of a bitch.


00:54:58.336 --> 00:55:03.086
Look, buddy. I may have been
a tank commander, too. Longer than you.


00:55:03.253 --> 00:55:06.586
Did you ask us if we want
to be under his control or not?


00:55:07.003 --> 00:55:11.336
Nikolai. We don't want to die for nothing.


00:55:14.878 --> 00:55:18.628
Guys. We will have to fight in this tank.


00:55:20.753 --> 00:55:23.503
We will fight German cadets.


00:55:23.628 --> 00:55:25.878
They will fire live shells at us.


00:55:28.211 --> 00:55:33.711
If we want to survive, we must prepare
the tank and do our job.


00:55:35.753 --> 00:55:37.461
Any questions?


00:55:39.253 --> 00:55:40.961
Just like gladiators?


00:55:44.378 --> 00:55:46.211
I read a book about them.


00:55:46.836 --> 00:55:49.503
- If anyone disagrees...
- I don't!


00:55:51.753 --> 00:55:54.836
If anyone disagrees, let me know
and I will send you back to the camp.


00:55:55.003 --> 00:55:57.753
I am sick and tired of loading trolleys.
I'd better go into combat.


00:55:59.753 --> 00:56:01.878
What do you think?


00:56:02.753 --> 00:56:05.628
Even if we survive,
what is going to happen next?


00:56:06.503 --> 00:56:09.128
We'll go into the next battle,
comrade driver.


00:56:09.586 --> 00:56:11.753
Did you forget that we are in the war?


00:56:13.086 --> 00:56:14.711
I did not.


00:56:18.170 --> 00:56:22.961
Waiting for your orders,
comrade commander.


00:57:15.878 --> 00:57:18.878
You can't go in there!
We disinfect the tank first!


00:57:25.128 --> 00:57:28.628
I found dead bodies
of the entire crew inside.


00:57:28.836 --> 00:57:31.836
Asking for permission to give
the tank crew a proper burial.


00:57:42.128 --> 00:57:44.461
Permission granted.


00:57:50.003 --> 00:57:51.461
Cache the hand grenades there, too.


00:59:09.253 --> 00:59:11.253
We'll avenge you, guys.


00:59:19.753 --> 00:59:20.503
Stepan.


00:59:22.961 --> 00:59:25.128
Guys. Can you rattle for me?


00:59:25.461 --> 00:59:26.586
Yes, sir.


00:59:33.253 --> 00:59:34.628
What is it?


00:59:34.753 --> 00:59:37.628
Can you rattle? Do it!


00:59:38.378 --> 00:59:41.628
- Rattle what?
- Your bones!


01:00:21.211 --> 01:00:24.253
Ionov! Do you think everyone is
as tall as you? Make it lower.


01:00:24.378 --> 01:00:28.628
Attention, crew. Here is the 3D
tactical map of the training grounds.


01:00:28.836 --> 01:00:31.878
You come here and look at it.


01:00:32.128 --> 01:00:34.961
You have to memorize it
like the Internationale.


01:00:35.128 --> 01:00:38.503
What if I always forgot the lyrics
in the third verse?


01:00:38.628 --> 01:00:40.503
- Ionov.
- Yes, comrade commander.


01:00:40.628 --> 01:00:44.211
You train Volchok in your free time.
Help the dummy.


01:00:44.378 --> 01:00:46.253
I will help the dummy,
comrade commander.


01:00:46.295 --> 01:00:47.253
You...


01:00:51.461 --> 01:00:54.253
This is the place where we were.


01:00:54.461 --> 01:00:55.878
And this is...


01:00:58.336 --> 01:01:00.503
The tank.


01:01:02.378 --> 01:01:04.878
- Commander.
- Yes?


01:01:07.753 --> 01:01:09.253
Can I have a word with you?


01:01:12.128 --> 01:01:13.461
Let's go fix the headlight.


01:01:21.378 --> 01:01:23.753
What are you planning to do?


01:01:24.503 --> 01:01:26.503
You guess.


01:01:26.628 --> 01:01:28.836
You want to flee in the tank?


01:01:29.253 --> 01:01:31.003
Why not?


01:01:31.461 --> 01:01:33.753
We are 300 km away from the Czechs.


01:01:34.253 --> 01:01:35.920
We've got a brand new T-34.


01:01:35.920 --> 01:01:38.711
ItвЂ™s just a six hours
ride down the highway.


01:01:40.628 --> 01:01:44.503
We have no chance.


01:01:48.878 --> 01:01:51.378
Think about it, Stepan.


01:01:51.586 --> 01:01:53.878
We have six shells.


01:01:54.086 --> 01:01:56.711
If we take the risk,
there is a reasonable chance of success.


01:01:57.378 --> 01:02:00.961
You are the best tank driver
in the entire Red Army.


01:02:01.461 --> 01:02:04.878
Come on.


01:02:05.503 --> 01:02:09.628
Remember, we ate a German tank company
for breakfast near Moscow.


01:02:09.836 --> 01:02:12.628
My dear Nikolai, when was that?


01:02:12.836 --> 01:02:16.503
But now we are like a rabbit
who has to kill a wolf.


01:02:22.628 --> 01:02:27.378
Out there is our freedom, Stepan.


01:02:29.461 --> 01:02:32.086
Out there is our victory.


01:02:33.378 --> 01:02:35.003
Are you with me?


01:02:43.003 --> 01:02:46.253
You asked for it.


01:02:47.336 --> 01:02:50.628
I am with you, commander. I am with you.


01:02:52.253 --> 01:02:54.628
Prepare the tank, Stepan.


01:03:04.878 --> 01:03:07.128
Ivushkin, the boss is calling.


01:03:08.836 --> 01:03:11.628
Our boss is in the Kremlin, miss.


01:03:28.753 --> 01:03:30.961
Come in!


01:03:38.336 --> 01:03:40.378
My colleague.


01:03:41.961 --> 01:03:43.753
Come here.


01:03:49.461 --> 01:03:52.003
How are the tank repairs coming along?


01:04:01.503 --> 01:04:02.961
I need another two or three days.


01:04:06.586 --> 01:04:08.253
Sit down.


01:04:16.128 --> 01:04:19.836
You will go into battle soon, Ivushkin.
I will brief you on your mission.


01:04:24.128 --> 01:04:28.003
Ivushkin, do you mind me calling you
by your family name?


01:04:29.378 --> 01:04:31.628
My first name is Nikolai.


01:04:39.878 --> 01:04:42.961
We are kind of namesakes.
My name is Klaus.


01:04:43.253 --> 01:04:46.503
Like Nikolaus. You get it?


01:04:47.086 --> 01:04:50.753
Nikolai, Nikolaus. Klaus.


01:05:00.128 --> 01:05:01.628
Listen, Nikolai.


01:05:10.503 --> 01:05:12.503
You will take up...


01:05:15.378 --> 01:05:16.628
...the position here.


01:05:19.253 --> 01:05:21.003
In an ambush.


01:05:27.836 --> 01:05:30.128
My Panther tanks...


01:05:31.878 --> 01:05:34.211
My Panther tanks will approach you.


01:05:48.378 --> 01:05:50.503
Do you follow me?


01:05:53.461 --> 01:05:57.461
I will do some stealth maneuvering
and reach an attack point.


01:06:36.003 --> 01:06:38.878
Back then, near Moscow did you dig in
under the haystack?


01:06:39.003 --> 01:06:43.753
Far from it. I took my position
an hour before dawn.


01:06:44.086 --> 01:06:46.753
We barely had time
to throw some hay on the tank.


01:06:54.336 --> 01:06:56.503
What if I had spotted you?


01:06:56.711 --> 01:07:00.628
- I would have called in the artillery.
- But you hadn't spotted me.


01:07:13.878 --> 01:07:15.753
To your health!


01:07:18.378 --> 01:07:20.128
May your liver go into pieces!


01:07:23.211 --> 01:07:25.378
Here is to a long and happy life.


01:07:52.003 --> 01:07:54.628
And you hook it up.


01:08:30.253 --> 01:08:31.503
Crew, fall in!


01:08:42.628 --> 01:08:44.253
Attention!


01:08:51.961 --> 01:08:54.628
Well done. No time wasted.


01:08:58.086 --> 01:09:00.753
Get ready for a performance test.


01:09:02.336 --> 01:09:04.878
Crew, post!


01:09:05.253 --> 01:09:07.128
Yes, comrade commander.


01:09:14.253 --> 01:09:15.711
Crew, report when ready.


01:09:17.211 --> 01:09:19.086
- Ready!
- Ready!


01:09:20.253 --> 01:09:21.378
Always ready!


01:09:22.461 --> 01:09:24.253
Forward!


01:09:26.586 --> 01:09:28.628
Yes, sir!


01:09:34.461 --> 01:09:38.336
Now, that's a vehicle! What a beast!


01:09:42.586 --> 01:09:45.753
Show them some ballet dancing,
Stepan Savelyevich!


01:09:45.961 --> 01:09:50.586
Yes, sir. Enjoy the Swan Lake.
Hold on, guys!


01:10:12.086 --> 01:10:14.003
The Belarusian is an ace!


01:10:28.586 --> 01:10:30.503
That was hell of a twist!


01:10:40.378 --> 01:10:43.253
You can't match us, you can't catch us.


01:11:03.628 --> 01:11:06.586
Come on! Did you shit your pants?


01:11:10.753 --> 01:11:12.753
You are never too old to learn, Quasimodo.


01:11:13.836 --> 01:11:15.086
Tillike.


01:11:16.503 --> 01:11:19.586
Lay the mine fields
all around the training grounds.


01:11:20.128 --> 01:11:22.003
Got it.


01:11:24.253 --> 01:11:26.628
Hello, sweetie. Come on in.
I will take you on a tank tour.


01:11:40.628 --> 01:11:41.753
What is wrong?


01:11:42.628 --> 01:11:45.086
Jager put the troops on full combat alert.


01:11:45.378 --> 01:11:47.961
They are laying mines
around the training grounds.


01:11:50.253 --> 01:11:52.253
Will you try it anyway?


01:11:52.878 --> 01:11:54.378
What?


01:11:54.836 --> 01:11:56.253
A breakthrough.


01:11:58.753 --> 01:12:01.003
Nikolai, I am neither blind, nor deaf.


01:12:03.128 --> 01:12:05.253
We can't do it without a map.


01:12:06.378 --> 01:12:09.003
I will bring you the map
from Jager's office.


01:12:10.253 --> 01:12:12.003
No, you will be the prime suspect.


01:12:19.003 --> 01:12:21.086
Will you take me along?


01:12:23.211 --> 01:12:24.836
No.


01:12:29.711 --> 01:12:32.878
Nikolai, I prefer dying by your side
to being a prisoner.


01:12:33.503 --> 01:12:35.336
Here is the mold. Make a key.


01:12:39.336 --> 01:12:41.003
I won't stay here alone.


01:12:43.961 --> 01:12:45.878
I'd better die.


01:13:01.711 --> 01:13:03.003
Cadets!


01:13:04.211 --> 01:13:06.836
You have a tactical combat test today.


01:13:07.336 --> 01:13:12.378
I am sure that you will prove to be
true bearers of the German spirit!


01:13:13.336 --> 01:13:15.003
Remember this.


01:13:16.128 --> 01:13:18.461
if you can fight the Russians,


01:13:19.628 --> 01:13:22.461
the Anglo-Saxons will be no match for you!


01:13:23.253 --> 01:13:26.878
The Reich will rule the world.


01:13:28.336 --> 01:13:29.586
Good luck!


01:13:45.878 --> 01:13:47.753
Guys.


01:13:49.003 --> 01:13:51.378
They laid mines all around
the training grounds.


01:13:51.503 --> 01:13:54.878
We will attempt to break
through the main gates.


01:13:55.253 --> 01:13:57.836
Three Panthers are against us out there.


01:13:58.003 --> 01:14:01.003
We have 6 shells
and enough fuel to cover 30 km.


01:14:05.586 --> 01:14:08.253
There's just one thing I want to tell you.


01:14:09.378 --> 01:14:13.961
This is the minute
we have been waiting for so long.


01:14:15.128 --> 01:14:19.253
Overwhelmed with fury and hatred
for the enemy, and contempt to death,


01:14:19.378 --> 01:14:23.711
I swear to crush the Nazi vermin
in its own lair!


01:14:33.128 --> 01:14:36.503
I swear.


01:14:38.586 --> 01:14:39.878
Crew.


01:14:44.003 --> 01:14:45.253
Prepare for action.


01:14:56.878 --> 01:14:58.878
Lord, grant Thy peace upon his soul...


01:14:59.086 --> 01:15:02.378
Sorry, guys. Rest in peace.


01:15:10.961 --> 01:15:13.253
We've got 4 armour piercing shells
and 2 fragmentation ones.


01:15:14.586 --> 01:15:16.961
Pray to stay alive, Nazis.


01:15:33.961 --> 01:15:36.253
Report the location of the Russian tank.


01:15:36.461 --> 01:15:39.253
The Russians left their starting position.


01:15:41.003 --> 01:15:42.586
Not bad.


01:15:43.753 --> 01:15:46.336
The cadets are moving in a straight line.


01:15:47.253 --> 01:15:48.961
Good job.


01:15:49.128 --> 01:15:52.336
- The Russians are setting up an ambush.
- Good. We move on.


01:17:20.461 --> 01:17:22.211
Oh my God.


01:17:34.378 --> 01:17:36.628
Unbelievable.


01:18:03.503 --> 01:18:05.878
The cadets are approaching
the Russian ambush.


01:18:16.336 --> 01:18:19.128
Standartenfuhrer, your pipe.


01:18:20.003 --> 01:18:21.753
Not bad for a start.


01:18:24.753 --> 01:18:26.961
Where are you going?


01:18:30.211 --> 01:18:32.211
In accordance with Administrative Order 11


01:18:32.378 --> 01:18:35.961
signed by the General Plenipotentiary
for Labour Deployment,


01:18:36.128 --> 01:18:38.878
Gauleiter of Thuringia,
Obergruppenfuhrer Sauckel


01:18:40.378 --> 01:18:43.753
I have the right to a single exit
outside the secure perimeter.


01:18:50.503 --> 01:18:52.711
You come back before 8 o'clock.


01:18:53.211 --> 01:18:54.253
Go!


01:18:54.378 --> 01:18:57.378
- Farewell, dummy.
- Open the gates!


01:19:29.086 --> 01:19:32.628
A smokescreen is a good idea.
Did you expect it?


01:19:33.003 --> 01:19:35.378
The Russian commander is smart.


01:19:38.628 --> 01:19:40.003
Bless us, O Lord.


01:19:49.878 --> 01:19:52.253
- Driver, start the engine.
- Yes, sir.


01:19:58.586 --> 01:20:00.086
Keep your eyes open.


01:20:03.461 --> 01:20:06.628
Come on, kitty. Show us your side.


01:20:07.003 --> 01:20:09.003
Volchok, do your job.


01:20:10.836 --> 01:20:13.753
- Tank, left.
- Tank, left. Yes, sir.


01:20:17.503 --> 01:20:20.378
- Identified.
- Fire.


01:20:28.878 --> 01:20:31.711
What the hell is that, Jager?


01:20:32.586 --> 01:20:34.628
It's burning!


01:20:34.836 --> 01:20:38.378
- We got them!
- Good job, Volchok! Driver, move in!


01:20:38.503 --> 01:20:43.128
That was awesome, Volchok!
You tore the kitty to pieces!


01:20:43.336 --> 01:20:45.503
I hate to hear it meow!


01:20:56.003 --> 01:20:57.503
Where did they get the shells?!


01:20:58.003 --> 01:20:59.753
Move, move!


01:20:59.878 --> 01:21:02.336
Ready the gun! Direct at the hill!


01:21:04.128 --> 01:21:06.128
Contact the Panther crews.


01:21:06.461 --> 01:21:08.003
Attention! Full combat alert!


01:21:08.128 --> 01:21:10.003
Full combat alert!


01:21:11.003 --> 01:21:13.253
We are in a radio contact
with the Panthers.


01:21:13.378 --> 01:21:16.753
Standartenfuhrer Jager speaking.
Tank 2, status update!


01:21:16.878 --> 01:21:18.628
Tank 3, tell me what you see.


01:21:30.003 --> 01:21:32.753
Come on! Step on it!


01:21:33.878 --> 01:21:36.253
Tanks, move out!
Tank 2, rotate to 10 o'clock!


01:21:36.378 --> 01:21:38.253
Tank 3, rotate to 11 o'clock.


01:21:38.461 --> 01:21:41.503
If you see the enemy, fire at will.


01:21:51.878 --> 01:21:53.878
Where is he?


01:21:54.003 --> 01:21:57.628
Comrade commander,
they are waiting for us now!


01:21:58.253 --> 01:22:01.336
- Ionov, load a fragmentation shell.
- Yes, sir!


01:22:04.003 --> 01:22:04.753
Up.


01:22:05.003 --> 01:22:06.503
The tower!


01:22:31.503 --> 01:22:33.253
Shit!


01:22:33.461 --> 01:22:35.128
He is at 10 o'clock!


01:22:35.336 --> 01:22:36.836
With compliments, scumbags!


01:23:08.753 --> 01:23:11.878
- Assholes!
- Driver, step on it!


01:23:14.086 --> 01:23:17.711
- Where should we go?
- We break through the gates, Stepan!


01:23:18.128 --> 01:23:19.753
We break through the gates!


01:23:19.878 --> 01:23:22.711
- Hide behind the warehouse!
- Yes, sir!


01:23:25.878 --> 01:23:28.003
Move! They are trying to escape!


01:23:42.628 --> 01:23:45.378
Get yourself together! Give orders!


01:23:48.628 --> 01:23:51.086
Prepare to engage!


01:23:51.253 --> 01:23:55.086
Hold on, guys! We are taking off!


01:24:22.503 --> 01:24:26.378
- What is that?
- These are German cars.


01:24:26.503 --> 01:24:27.628
Not anymore.


01:24:27.836 --> 01:24:29.753
Go for the gates, Stepan!


01:24:36.586 --> 01:24:37.878
A machine gun!


01:24:38.003 --> 01:24:40.003
Driver, close the window!


01:24:43.753 --> 01:24:46.961
- Scare them off, Volchok!
- Yes, sir.


01:24:51.586 --> 01:24:53.378
Will you ever stop shooting?...


01:25:01.003 --> 01:25:02.503
Go for the gates!


01:25:13.086 --> 01:25:16.378
- Step on it, Stepan!
- Come on, Belarusian!


01:25:36.003 --> 01:25:39.211
Hooray!


01:25:48.336 --> 01:25:50.336
Stop it!


01:27:07.253 --> 01:27:09.128
Hello, ladies.


01:27:15.378 --> 01:27:17.128
Where would you like to go?


01:27:19.003 --> 01:27:22.211
Good job, comrade Yartseva.


01:27:24.586 --> 01:27:26.211
Good luck, ladies.


01:27:26.378 --> 01:27:30.836
Hop in if you dare.
First, we'll have to go to Prague.


01:27:34.086 --> 01:27:36.586
Move over down there.


01:27:37.753 --> 01:27:39.628
Hi!


01:27:39.836 --> 01:27:42.586
- Hello.
- Hello, my friends.


01:27:42.753 --> 01:27:43.753
Good bye, ladies.


01:27:43.961 --> 01:27:47.003
Please, come here. This is your seat.


01:27:51.253 --> 01:27:53.836
Welcome to our tank.


01:28:02.128 --> 01:28:04.878
Set up an emergency command center!
Report our losses.


01:28:05.753 --> 01:28:09.336
Report to Department 1A
of the Military District Command!


01:28:15.378 --> 01:28:18.253
Deploy artillery and anti-armor units!


01:28:18.461 --> 01:28:19.211
Yes, sir!


01:28:19.378 --> 01:28:22.378
Block all the highways
within 50 kilometers!


01:28:29.128 --> 01:28:30.836
You won't get away...


01:28:31.378 --> 01:28:34.211
Step on it, driver,
before the Fritzes react.


01:28:34.503 --> 01:28:37.086
We will run out of fuel soon, commander.


01:28:37.461 --> 01:28:40.336
Our beast is hungry like a wolf.


01:28:40.503 --> 01:28:44.253
We are 20 km away from a town.


01:28:44.378 --> 01:28:46.378
We'll get some fuel there.


01:29:38.878 --> 01:29:43.711
Hey, Fritz! Fill it up
with the fuel oil! Understand?


01:29:59.211 --> 01:30:02.753
Stepan, why keep so close to the wall?


01:30:02.961 --> 01:30:05.211
I am used to doing that.


01:30:05.378 --> 01:30:07.753
You are a funny fellow!
We are deep in the enemy territory.


01:30:07.753 --> 01:30:09.920
The town is so small.


01:30:10.253 --> 01:30:14.503
Just a couple of police officers here.
Show them a tank parade.


01:30:30.711 --> 01:30:32.461
- Comrade commander!
- Tell me.


01:30:32.628 --> 01:30:35.628
The sun is high, and we are hungry.


01:30:35.836 --> 01:30:38.128
Awaiting your order to plunder the town.


01:30:39.961 --> 01:30:41.586
We don't plunder.


01:30:43.628 --> 01:30:45.378
Aren't you hungry?


01:30:46.128 --> 01:30:49.378
I am. We ask them to give us food.


01:30:49.503 --> 01:30:54.503
Ionov, Volchok, get ready to exit.
You have 5 minutes.


01:31:07.503 --> 01:31:10.378
On the outskirts
of a workers' neighborhood...


01:31:11.586 --> 01:31:15.211
What an obedient man, eh?
Give up the gear!


01:31:16.878 --> 01:31:17.878
Bitte.


01:31:33.461 --> 01:31:37.003
Be careful what you wish for.


01:31:39.003 --> 01:31:41.211
Thank you.


01:31:43.878 --> 01:31:47.378
Girls, have you ever tried to eat bats?


01:31:47.586 --> 01:31:50.753
I have. They are okay. Quite nutritious.


01:31:59.503 --> 01:32:02.003
I am happy now.


01:32:07.628 --> 01:32:10.378
Thank you. Bye.


01:32:31.503 --> 01:32:36.253
Stepan, step on it. We have to reach
the foothills and hide there.


01:32:43.628 --> 01:32:45.628
Move left!


01:33:04.878 --> 01:33:06.378
Is everyone okay?


01:33:06.961 --> 01:33:09.878
- Yartseva?
- I am fine.


01:33:11.628 --> 01:33:16.503
- What was that?
- They put an anti-air gun on the road!


01:33:16.961 --> 01:33:19.628
The scumbags blocked the highways.


01:33:20.128 --> 01:33:23.628
Stepan! Let's zigzag like a rabbit!


01:33:23.836 --> 01:33:25.711
Yes, sir!


01:34:00.878 --> 01:34:02.128
Staff office!


01:34:06.086 --> 01:34:07.128
Yes, sir.


01:34:13.878 --> 01:34:16.753
The Ivans have just miraculously escaped
our anti-air gun in Weimar.


01:34:20.753 --> 01:34:22.753
Ivans the Magicians!


01:34:24.003 --> 01:34:26.711
Just what I thought.


01:34:27.878 --> 01:34:30.753
They are going to the border
of Protectorate of Bohemia and Moravia.


01:34:31.753 --> 01:34:33.586
We drove them off the highway.


01:34:34.378 --> 01:34:37.253
Now we have to tighten
the net on minor roads.


01:34:37.503 --> 01:34:39.461
What is going to happen next?


01:34:39.628 --> 01:34:41.253
They are in a trap now.


01:34:42.461 --> 01:34:45.836
Tillike, call in the air force.


01:34:46.586 --> 01:34:48.878
- Yes, sir.
- And the psychics, too.


01:34:53.086 --> 01:34:55.253
You can even
call the Ahnenerbe institute.


01:35:01.336 --> 01:35:03.378
I am off to Berlin.


01:35:03.503 --> 01:35:06.628
Jager, if you don't catch the runaways
tomorrow morning,


01:35:08.003 --> 01:35:10.461
I will not be able to help you.


01:35:47.503 --> 01:35:52.003
Here are the Erzgebirge! Czechoslovakia!


01:36:43.336 --> 01:36:44.836
One more time.


01:36:45.003 --> 01:36:47.253
I know they are somewhere here.


01:36:48.128 --> 01:36:51.461
Herr Standartenfuhrer, we are low on fuel!


01:36:51.628 --> 01:36:53.086
We fly on!


01:36:56.503 --> 01:37:00.211
Herr Standartenfuhrer,
we have to go back now.


01:37:00.378 --> 01:37:01.961
We fly on!


01:37:02.128 --> 01:37:05.836
- Repeat, we have to go back right now!
- They are here!


01:37:06.253 --> 01:37:10.253
- Keep calm. Lower.
- Roger that.


01:37:25.961 --> 01:37:29.628
Commander, the beast is good.
But it is going to overheat soon.


01:37:32.378 --> 01:37:33.378
Stepan!


01:37:33.753 --> 01:37:35.878
We must get to the mountain pass.


01:37:36.086 --> 01:37:37.503
We'll spend the night there.


01:37:37.628 --> 01:37:39.128
Yes, sir.


01:37:40.003 --> 01:37:44.128
Thank you, tank gods! I thought we were
going to Berlin non-stop!


01:37:44.378 --> 01:37:47.336
Berlin is the opposite direction.


01:37:53.211 --> 01:37:56.628
Go as low as possible
and fly along the road.


01:37:58.628 --> 01:38:00.503
Lower!


01:38:08.378 --> 01:38:09.628
Even lower.


01:38:18.336 --> 01:38:20.086
Lower!


01:38:48.378 --> 01:38:50.378
I got you!


01:39:09.753 --> 01:39:10.753
Stepan Savelyevich!


01:39:13.378 --> 01:39:14.503
Yes, sir.


01:39:14.628 --> 01:39:16.461
You know what you have to do.


01:39:16.628 --> 01:39:19.503
We can't move on in the forest at night.
We'll wait for the dawn.


01:39:19.628 --> 01:39:22.253
- Ionov. Get some firewood.
- Yes, sir.


01:39:22.378 --> 01:39:24.336
Volchok, inspect the forest around us.


01:39:24.878 --> 01:39:26.253
I'll be happy to do that.


01:39:26.878 --> 01:39:28.586
- Yartseva.
- Yes?


01:39:28.753 --> 01:39:30.878
- Make us some dinner.
- Yes, sir.


01:39:48.753 --> 01:39:50.753
Comrade commander, permission to speak.


01:39:51.753 --> 01:39:52.711
Shoot.


01:39:52.878 --> 01:39:57.503
There is a body of water close by.
I suggest going for some spa treatments.


01:39:59.878 --> 01:40:01.753
Keep quiet.


01:40:29.211 --> 01:40:32.128
Hurray!


01:40:34.586 --> 01:40:36.878
We are free!


01:41:15.253 --> 01:41:17.503
We are at the position.


01:41:21.336 --> 01:41:22.336
I found them.


01:41:22.503 --> 01:41:23.836
The Russians are in
the area between


01:41:23.878 --> 01:41:25.545
Klingenthal, Zwickau,
Chemnitz and Annaberg.


01:41:25.711 --> 01:41:28.003
- Send out the first platoon.
- Yes, sir.


01:41:28.128 --> 01:41:30.961
- I want to call Berlin.
- Call Berlin now.


01:41:35.878 --> 01:41:38.461
Standartenfuhrer Jager reporting.
I found them.


01:41:38.628 --> 01:41:41.336
The runaways will be eliminated by 8 am.


01:41:42.378 --> 01:41:45.836
A bullet flew


01:41:47.336 --> 01:41:50.003
Over the mountain


01:41:50.753 --> 01:41:56.586
And it hit a guy straight in his chest


01:41:57.711 --> 01:42:04.336
It hit the guy straight in his chest


01:42:05.878 --> 01:42:11.461
The blood flowed like a river


01:42:12.503 --> 01:42:20.461
The blood flowed like a river


01:42:20.628 --> 01:42:27.128
And it reached the Danube river


01:42:29.836 --> 01:42:35.628
My mother went there to bring water


01:42:36.503 --> 01:42:42.086
And to remember her son


01:42:43.378 --> 01:42:49.003
Oh Mother. Why do we want a war?


01:42:49.753 --> 01:42:56.003
Where my son was killed...


01:43:14.253 --> 01:43:16.128
Okay, guys.


01:43:16.336 --> 01:43:18.211
Enough.


01:43:18.378 --> 01:43:20.336
We are 50 kilometers away
from the Slavkov forest.


01:43:20.878 --> 01:43:24.253
We accomplished our mission.
We derailed the Fritzes' plan.


01:43:25.378 --> 01:43:28.128
Here is my order.
We sink the tank in the lake.


01:43:28.253 --> 01:43:31.378
We take some rest and then split.


01:43:31.503 --> 01:43:33.378
We must survive.


01:43:38.628 --> 01:43:42.753
Nikolai, I joined you on my own free will.


01:43:43.711 --> 01:43:46.753
- May I tell you something?
- Please, do.


01:43:48.253 --> 01:43:50.503
I don't want to dump the tank.


01:43:51.003 --> 01:43:54.878
Comrade commander,
I won't go anywhere without you.


01:43:56.586 --> 01:43:58.586
We are Red Army soldiers.


01:43:59.461 --> 01:44:03.086
We took an oath to beat the enemy
to the last drop of our blood.


01:44:04.503 --> 01:44:07.003
- Leaving a horse behind is shameful.
- Volchok!


01:44:08.086 --> 01:44:11.253
You've got an eagle's eye and a keen ear.


01:44:11.753 --> 01:44:13.378
You should perform
in a circus.


01:44:13.420 --> 01:44:15.920
I spent too much time
out there in the taiga.


01:44:16.086 --> 01:44:18.711
- Driver!
- Watch your tongue.


01:44:32.378 --> 01:44:33.420
Okay.


01:44:33.878 --> 01:44:36.336
You can have another drink.


01:44:36.503 --> 01:44:40.003
Everyone goes to sleep in 5 min.
We wake up at 4 am and leave.


01:44:40.211 --> 01:44:41.878
Lookouts change every hour.


01:46:09.503 --> 01:46:11.461
Look.


01:46:12.836 --> 01:46:14.378
A star fell down.


01:46:15.628 --> 01:46:17.378
Nikolai.


01:46:17.753 --> 01:46:20.378
Did you make a wish?


01:46:20.586 --> 01:46:22.128
Of course.


01:46:24.253 --> 01:46:26.378
I want to love you forever.


01:46:29.086 --> 01:46:30.628
Hug me, Nikolai.


01:46:33.003 --> 01:46:34.628
I waited for you my entire life.


01:47:17.753 --> 01:47:20.961
Anna, wake up.


01:47:21.628 --> 01:47:24.336
Wake up. It's an alarm.


01:47:37.378 --> 01:47:39.753
Crew, wake up! Jager is here.


01:47:44.461 --> 01:47:46.336
They'll block the mountain
pass in the morning.


01:47:46.336 --> 01:47:47.836
We have to break
through in the dark.


01:47:50.461 --> 01:47:51.503
Anna...


01:47:53.211 --> 01:47:55.253
You can't go with us in the tank.


01:47:55.461 --> 01:47:59.753
- I will not stay here without you.
- Anna, listen to me.


01:48:00.378 --> 01:48:02.336
They cornered us. We'll break through.


01:48:02.503 --> 01:48:05.503
We'll keep them busy and you go east.


01:48:05.836 --> 01:48:07.878
Look at the map.


01:48:09.211 --> 01:48:13.503
We are here.
Klingenthal is the only town close by.


01:48:14.086 --> 01:48:18.253
You have to pass it by the left side.
You will see a big meadow.


01:48:18.378 --> 01:48:20.378
- Got it.
- You will wait for us there.


01:48:20.503 --> 01:48:22.628
If we don't come tomorrow night,


01:48:22.753 --> 01:48:24.753
don't wait any longer.
You go east at night.


01:48:24.961 --> 01:48:28.003
Due east. You got it?


01:48:28.503 --> 01:48:32.086
- I got it.
- Anna...


01:48:33.836 --> 01:48:35.836
We have to do it, my love.


01:48:40.003 --> 01:48:44.128
Don't be afraid, comrade gunner.


01:48:44.253 --> 01:48:47.128
- The forest will never give you away.
- Thank you.


01:48:49.336 --> 01:48:51.628
Take it, darling. You'll need it.


01:48:51.836 --> 01:48:54.503
- See you.
- See you.


01:48:57.961 --> 01:48:59.961
See you later, my love.


01:49:02.503 --> 01:49:05.878
Go, go, go.


01:49:47.878 --> 01:49:49.128
It's an ambush.


01:49:49.711 --> 01:49:52.878
Someone left a suitcase
and a baby stroller in the street.


01:49:52.920 --> 01:49:54.878
No German would do that.


01:49:55.378 --> 01:49:57.628
Looks like they evacuated the civilians.


01:49:57.753 --> 01:49:59.628
They are waiting for us.


01:50:01.003 --> 01:50:03.128
- Stepan.
- Yes?


01:50:03.253 --> 01:50:05.961
Move out and go to the side street.


01:50:06.128 --> 01:50:08.253
We'll take a detour.


01:51:29.128 --> 01:51:31.211
Prepare for action!


01:51:52.211 --> 01:51:54.753
There's a Panther to the left!
Another one!


01:51:55.128 --> 01:51:56.336
You scumbag!


01:52:02.086 --> 01:52:04.128
We can't go through their head armor!


01:52:04.836 --> 01:52:07.461
Fire a fragmentation
shell at the bottom plate!


01:52:11.753 --> 01:52:14.753
- Reload!
- Yes, sir!


01:52:19.878 --> 01:52:21.336
Set up a delay!


01:52:23.461 --> 01:52:27.086
- Can you aim on the move?
- I can, comrade commander!


01:52:30.378 --> 01:52:32.003
Stepan, easy!


01:52:34.878 --> 01:52:36.836
- Identified!
- Fire!


01:52:48.253 --> 01:52:51.003
- It's burning!
- Good job, Volchok!


01:52:51.378 --> 01:52:52.961
I am fucking speechless!


01:52:54.253 --> 01:52:56.628
Cool down now!


01:53:05.128 --> 01:53:06.961
Tank 114 destroyed.


01:53:07.128 --> 01:53:11.253
The Russians are moving towards the main
square. Go to the backup positions.


01:53:13.753 --> 01:53:14.878
Watch out!


01:53:21.003 --> 01:53:24.711
Wait here. I will take a look around.


01:54:06.503 --> 01:54:09.961
The street is 8 meters wide.


01:54:10.128 --> 01:54:15.711
A tank moving at 20 km per hour covers
5,5 meters every second.


01:54:16.378 --> 01:54:20.461
The Germans will have 1,5 seconds
to take a shot.


01:54:21.836 --> 01:54:24.003
We have to distract them.


01:54:30.628 --> 01:54:33.711
Don't miss it when he comes here.


01:54:34.836 --> 01:54:36.128
Yes, sir.


01:54:37.378 --> 01:54:40.378
- Where should I go, comrade commander?
- Wait, Stepan.


01:54:43.461 --> 01:54:46.378
We are in a trap.
Three Panther tanks are all around us.


01:54:47.503 --> 01:54:51.836
Here is the plan.
Who is the worst daredevil here?


01:54:53.503 --> 01:54:56.086
Don't ask.
You give me an order, commander.


01:55:06.836 --> 01:55:10.003
Look here. This is our current position.


01:55:10.211 --> 01:55:13.628
It's dark outside and their tank
commanders keep the hatches open.


01:55:14.336 --> 01:55:16.628
This tank is yours.
You must distract them.


01:55:17.003 --> 01:55:18.336
You got me?


01:55:19.461 --> 01:55:22.211
I got you just right.


01:55:29.378 --> 01:55:31.128
Do it.


01:55:41.628 --> 01:55:43.503
Guys.


01:55:44.961 --> 01:55:46.253
Good luck.


01:55:52.128 --> 01:55:54.878
Good luck to you too, Serafim. Good luck.


01:56:12.753 --> 01:56:15.461
When you hear the explosion, step on it!


01:56:15.628 --> 01:56:18.711
- Where should I go?
- Can you see the wall?


01:56:19.711 --> 01:56:21.336
Yes.


01:56:21.503 --> 01:56:23.836
There should be an
exit on the other side.


01:56:23.836 --> 01:56:25.420
What if there isn't any?


01:56:27.586 --> 01:56:29.003
Then we are dead.


01:57:11.461 --> 01:57:13.253
You are the man, Volchok!


01:57:26.961 --> 01:57:28.378
You missed it, screw up!


01:57:37.003 --> 01:57:39.628
112 and 115, move on to the square.
We'll corner them.


01:57:46.878 --> 01:57:49.086
Here we go!


01:57:57.836 --> 01:58:02.378
There is a Panther straight under
our nose! Rotate 180 degrees!


01:58:08.003 --> 01:58:10.503
They are turning the turret!
Come on, commander!


01:58:10.711 --> 01:58:13.086
- Load the gun!
- Three shells left!


01:58:13.253 --> 01:58:15.003
Son of a bitch!


01:58:21.003 --> 01:58:24.378
- Come on!
- Where is his gun?


01:58:25.003 --> 01:58:26.961
We can make it! Keep turning!


01:58:29.753 --> 01:58:30.711
Come on!


01:58:36.003 --> 01:58:37.753
Load the gun!


01:58:53.503 --> 01:58:55.503
Shoot!


01:58:55.628 --> 01:58:57.211
Just a second!


02:00:04.378 --> 02:00:06.003
Are you okay?


02:00:06.753 --> 02:00:08.128
Stop!


02:00:11.503 --> 02:00:13.961
115, prepare to fire!


02:00:37.253 --> 02:00:39.211
Farewell, fellows.


02:01:09.503 --> 02:01:10.836
Who fired at them?


02:01:11.836 --> 02:01:14.753
Volchok did it! No one else could do that.


02:01:14.961 --> 02:01:18.628
Did he seize a Panther?


02:01:18.836 --> 02:01:20.961
We have two tanks now!


02:01:29.503 --> 02:01:33.503
Gunner, Tank 112. Up and fire!


02:01:33.878 --> 02:01:36.378
I can't shoot at my comrades.


02:01:36.586 --> 02:01:38.003
Your comrades are dead.


02:01:38.045 --> 02:01:40.586
The Russians seized the tank!
They will destroy us!


02:01:40.628 --> 02:01:43.003
Move over!


02:01:51.586 --> 02:01:54.628
- Load the gun!
- It's that horned devil again.


02:02:27.128 --> 02:02:28.128
Guys.


02:02:28.711 --> 02:02:30.461
You, son of a bitch!


02:02:32.878 --> 02:02:35.128
Don't think he is dead.
He is a lucky guy.


02:03:05.503 --> 02:03:09.836
Is this what you want? Okay.


02:03:24.086 --> 02:03:28.253
Oh you, rotten dog's liver!


02:03:31.003 --> 02:03:34.378
5 minutes, Nikolaus!


02:03:38.503 --> 02:03:41.253
Let me pick up my comrade, first.


02:03:58.003 --> 02:03:59.503
Here I am, Nikolai.


02:04:04.378 --> 02:04:07.628
Dudes. Here is my plan.


02:04:07.753 --> 02:04:11.628
Stepan. We come
on to the bridge at full speed.


02:04:11.753 --> 02:04:14.128
You start dodging at my command.


02:04:14.253 --> 02:04:16.586
Serafim, load the gun.


02:04:18.503 --> 02:04:20.753
It's the last one. Up.


02:04:20.878 --> 02:04:23.878
We must come
as close to them as possible.


02:04:24.003 --> 02:04:25.961
The probability of success is 1 in 1000.


02:04:26.128 --> 02:04:29.336
The plan is perfect. For a circus show.


02:04:29.878 --> 02:04:31.086
We'll be the stars of it.


02:04:32.003 --> 02:04:33.878
I feel scared.


02:04:34.003 --> 02:04:37.878
Volchok, keep your pecker up!


02:04:40.628 --> 02:04:42.128
Forward!


02:04:53.211 --> 02:04:54.836
Forward!


02:05:00.753 --> 02:05:03.753
Our Father, who art in Heaven.


02:05:03.878 --> 02:05:05.586
Hallowed be Thy name...


02:05:07.128 --> 02:05:08.628
I am not going to kill you.


02:05:09.711 --> 02:05:11.586
I will take away your turret. Stop!


02:05:13.836 --> 02:05:14.753
To the right!


02:05:20.128 --> 02:05:21.461
...Thy kingdom come,


02:05:21.628 --> 02:05:24.378
Your will be done in earth,
as it is in Heaven;


02:05:24.503 --> 02:05:25.878
I will take away your shield.


02:05:26.003 --> 02:05:27.628
To the left!


02:05:33.753 --> 02:05:35.128
To the right!


02:05:46.378 --> 02:05:48.253
Fuck!


02:05:48.378 --> 02:05:50.086
Give us this day our daily bread,


02:05:50.253 --> 02:05:51.878
and forgive us our trespasses,


02:05:52.003 --> 02:05:54.003
as we forgive those
who trespass against us.


02:05:54.586 --> 02:05:56.253
And lead us not into temptation...


02:05:57.378 --> 02:05:59.003
And your tracks.


02:06:03.878 --> 02:06:06.086
Eat this, scumbag!


02:06:21.753 --> 02:06:23.878
Throw him off the bridge, Stepan!


02:06:24.086 --> 02:06:26.086
- And forgive us our trespasses...
- Throw him off!


02:06:53.128 --> 02:06:55.378
Wait here.


02:07:39.461 --> 02:07:40.711
Shoot!


02:09:35.503 --> 02:09:39.253
Well, did we run out of Fritzes to kill?


02:09:40.378 --> 02:09:42.711
There are more coming.


02:09:45.503 --> 02:09:49.753
What are we going to do with the beast?
The fuel tank is half full.


02:09:49.878 --> 02:09:54.211
We won't leave it to the enemy.
Help Volchok out.


02:09:54.378 --> 02:09:56.711
We'll go on foot now.


02:11:02.878 --> 02:11:06.378
DEDICATED TO ALL TANK HEROES OF THE GREAT
PATRIOTIC WAR, WHO GOT FAMOUS


02:11:06.503 --> 02:11:10.003
OR REMAINED UNKNOWN, WHO WERE KILLED
IN ACTION OR CAME BACK HOME.


02:11:14.628 --> 02:11:18.003
Written and Directed by Aleksey Sidorov


02:11:19.003 --> 02:11:21.503
